)ATTR DEFAULT(@}_)
 @ TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE)
 } TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN)
 { TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(TURQ)
 _ TYPE(INPUT)  INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(RED)    CAPS(ON) JUST(LEFT)
 ! TYPE(OUTPUT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) CAPS(OFF) JUST(LEFT)
)BODY
@HELP: Messages -- P to Z                       !ISFHMSG                      }
@COMMAND INPUT ===>_ISFHCMD                                                   }
@PRINT CLOSED n LINE
}    PRINT CLOSE: the file is closed, with n lines; SYSOUT goes to print.
@PRINT NOT OPENED
}    PRINT CLOSE with no file open.
@PURGE FAILED RC n
}    P on the Status panel: JES2 did not purge the job, with that return
}    code.
@REPLIES NOT READABLE
}    SDSF could not get the authorized state to read the replies.
@TOO FEW PARMS}, @TOO MANY PARMS
}    The command needs more parameters, or has more than it takes.
@TOP OF DATA REACHED
}    FIND PREV went to the start without finding the string again. The
}    next FIND PREV starts over at the end.
@ISF001E ISFISP RUNS UNDER ISPF: SELECT PGM(ISFISP)
}    ISFISP was called outside ISPF. Start SDSF under ISPF: TSO SDSF from
}    an ISPF command line.
}
}
}
}
